+# (endpoint-preserving: 0/255 bytes kept so pixelscan's red-box `oe` term passes)
+# instead of the per-channel gamma LUT. Makes the WebGL render hash a pure function
+# of (seed, dimensions) — HOST-INDEPENDENT (the gamma preserves the real GPU's
+# render structure, so its clean-render-seed pool is per-host calibrated). OFF by
